            "• `/ilstock POLI` - Bank Hapoalim\n"
            "• `/ilstock NICE` - Nice Ltd\n"
            "• `/ilstock DSCT` - Israel Discount Bank\n"
            "• `/ilstock AZRG` - Azrieli Group\n\n"
